{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blumenia</i></strong>\u00a0is a visual novel where its characters represent each a real life plant. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet its characters and discover their stories and the things that make each of them unique.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>An adventure against time</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their world is affected by a drought and they need to find the solution before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clue takes our protagonists into a journey between The Four Seasons, where they'll meet other plants and face different problems in each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the truth of their world and bring back things to normality!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Primavera","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/d822efd9dfe37f0c6d9506cee87ed6340ce2ed3b.jpg"},{"name":"Verano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/2da20f7fc1c6566f19af8bd0fcf84618b60f49c6.jpg"},{"name":"Oto\u00f1o","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/f5e67e48f8eef93bff046704534077a0a0e25949.jpg"},{"name":"Invierno","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/f90b6e9c25bce062deb880cb24342a24dd08103b.jpg"},{"name":"Diario de Losus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/d30c18802c4d08710c3862e6cd281051f7ee25f2.jpg"},{"name":"Las Clases de Nely","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/1c4aeaac402da436280087cfb6585c4f835706cf.jpg"},{"name":"Recuerdos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3298390/1e0679c7df8a03c14396ddd87bba1dfb578532e5.jpg"},{"name":"Blumenia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/image